#ASSERT `Dieu 4(13): the cover is life insurance` `a combined life and health cover`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(15): the cover is health insurance` `a combined life and health cover`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(22): the cover is microinsurance` `a micro cover for a poor household`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(22): the cover is microinsurance` `a cover for the well-off`

§§ `Dieu 4: the enterprises (4(17)-(21), (23))`

@@q 138 166
@ref Dieu 4 (src:138-166)
@@fx `a licensed life insurer` : `An enterprise` ; `established, organised and operating under this Law and other related laws` = TRUE ; `operates to carry on insurance business, reinsurance business and ceding` = TRUE ; `carries on life insurance` = TRUE ; `is a legal person` = TRUE
@@fx `an enterprise not established under the Law` : `An enterprise` ; `operates to carry on insurance business, reinsurance business and ceding` = TRUE ; `carries on life insurance` = TRUE
@@fx `a reinsurance enterprise` : `An enterprise` ; `established, organised and operating under this Law and other related laws` = TRUE ; `operates to carry on reinsurance business and ceding` = TRUE
@@fx `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer in Vietnam` : `An enterprise` ; `is a dependent unit of a foreign insurer or reinsurer` = TRUE ; `the foreign body is a non-life insurer` = TRUE ; `the foreign insurer or reinsurer guarantees and answers for all its obligations in Vietnam` = TRUE
@@fx `a subsidiary company of a foreign non-life insurer` : `An enterprise` ; `is a dependent unit of a foreign insurer or reinsurer` = TRUE ; `the foreign body is a non-life insurer` = TRUE ; `the foreign insurer or reinsurer guarantees and answers for all its obligations in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `is a legal person` = TRUE
@@fx `a branch of a foreign reinsurer in Vietnam` : `An enterprise` ; `is a dependent unit of a foreign insurer or reinsurer` = TRUE ; `the foreign body is a reinsurer` = TRUE ; `the foreign insurer or reinsurer guarantees and answers for all its obligations in Vietnam` = TRUE
@@fx `a licensed broker` : `An enterprise` ; `established, organised and operating under this Law and other related laws` = TRUE ; `operates to carry on insurance brokerage activity` = TRUE
@@fx `a true mutual organisation` : `An enterprise` ; `is a legal person` = TRUE ; `keeps independent accounts` = TRUE ; `was founded by members or a body representing members` = TRUE ; `operates without a profit purpose, for mutual support among members` = TRUE ; `is voluntary, financially autonomous and answerable only within the assets formed from microinsurance` = TRUE
@@fx `a profit-making mutual organisation` : `An enterprise` ; `is a legal person` = TRUE ; `keeps independent accounts` = TRUE ; `was founded by members or a body representing members` = TRUE ; `is voluntary, financially autonomous and answerable only within the assets formed from microinsurance` = TRUE

#ASSERT `Dieu 4(17): the enterprise is an insurer (doanh nghiep bao hiem)` `a licensed life insurer`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(17): the enterprise is a life insurer` `a licensed life insurer`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(17): the enterprise is a non-life insurer` `a licensed life insurer`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(17): the enterprise is a health insurer` `a licensed life insurer`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(17): the enterprise is an insurer (doanh nghiep bao hiem)` `an enterprise not established under the Law`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(18): the enterprise is a reinsurer` `a reinsurance enterprise`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(18): the enterprise is a reinsurer` `a licensed life insurer`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(19): the enterprise is a branch of a foreign non-life insurer` `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer in Vietnam`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(19): the enterprise is a branch of a foreign non-life insurer` `a subsidiary company of a foreign non-life insurer`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(19): the enterprise is a branch of a foreign non-life insurer` `a branch of a foreign reinsurer in Vietnam`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(20): the enterprise is a branch of a foreign reinsurer` `a branch of a foreign reinsurer in Vietnam`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(21): the enterprise is an insurance broker` `a licensed broker`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(21): the enterprise is an insurance broker` `a reinsurance enterprise`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(23): the organisation is a microinsurance mutual organisation` `a true mutual organisation`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(23): the organisation is a microinsurance mutual organisation` `a profit-making mutual organisation`

§§ `Dieu 4: the contract and its parties (4(16), (24)-(29))`

@@q 132 190
@ref Dieu 4 (src:132-190)
@@fx `an agreement to pay premium against cover` : `A contract arrangement` ; `is an agreement between the policyholder and the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` = TRUE ; `the policyholder must pay premium under it` = TRUE ; `the insurer, branch or mutual organisation must compensate or pay as agreed under it` = TRUE
@@fx `a promise to pay with no premium` : `A contract arrangement` ; `is an agreement between the policyholder and the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` = TRUE ; `the insurer, branch or mutual organisation must compensate or pay as agreed under it` = TRUE
@@fx `two insurers sharing one contract` : `A contract arrangement` ; `several insurers or branches of foreign non-life insurers agreed to make it with the policyholder in one contract` = TRUE ; `they take premium and compensate or pay in the ratio agreed in the contract` = TRUE
@@fx `two insurers with no agreed ratio` : `A contract arrangement` ; `several insurers or branches of foreign non-life insurers agreed to make it with the policyholder in one contract` = TRUE
@@fx `a buyer who contracts and pays` : `A role in a contract` ; `concluded the contract of insurance with an insurer, branch or mutual organisation` = TRUE ; `pays the insurance premium` = TRUE
@@fx `a person who contracts but another pays` : `A role in a contract` ; `concluded the contract of insurance with an insurer, branch or mutual organisation` = TRUE
@@fx `a person whose life is insured` : `A role in a contract` ; `has property, civil liability, health, life, an obligation or an economic interest insured under the contract` = TRUE
@@fx `a designated recipient` : `A role in a contract` ; `was designated by the policyholder or the insured person to receive the insurance money as the contract agrees` = TRUE
@@fx `a payable event as agreed` : `An occurrence` ; `is an objective event` = TRUE ; `was agreed by the parties or is provided by law` = TRUE ; `obliges the insurer, branch or mutual organisation to compensate or pay under the contract when it occurs` = TRUE
@@fx `an event nobody agreed` : `An occurrence` ; `is an objective event` = TRUE ; `obliges the insurer, branch or mutual organisation to compensate or pay under the contract when it occurs` = TRUE
@@fx `a premium paid as agreed` : `A payment` ; `is made by the policyholder to the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` = TRUE ; `is required by law or agreed by the parties in the contract` = TRUE
@@fx `a gift to an insurer` : `A payment` ; `is made by the policyholder to the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` = TRUE

#ASSERT `Dieu 4(16): the arrangement is a contract of insurance` `an agreement to pay premium against cover`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(16): the arrangement is a contract of insurance` `a promise to pay with no premium`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(29): the arrangement is co-insurance (dong bao hiem)` `two insurers sharing one contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(29): the arrangement is co-insurance (dong bao hiem)` `two insurers with no agreed ratio`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(24): the person is the policyholder (ben mua bao hiem)` `a buyer who contracts and pays`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(24): the person is the policyholder (ben mua bao hiem)` `a person who contracts but another pays`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(25): the person is the insured person (nguoi duoc bao hiem)` `a person whose life is insured`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(26): the person is a beneficiary (nguoi thu huong)` `a designated recipient`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(26): the person is a beneficiary (nguoi thu huong)` `a person whose life is insured`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(27): the occurrence is an insured event (su kien bao hiem)` `a payable event as agreed`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(27): the occurrence is an insured event (su kien bao hiem)` `an event nobody agreed`
#ASSERT `Dieu 4(28): the payment is insurance premium (phi bao hiem)` `a premium paid as agreed`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 4(28): the payment is insurance premium (phi bao hiem)` `a gift to an insurer`

